          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obeeranga n'obwenkanya, era tobanga na kyekubiira ng'osala emisango. Tolyanga nguzi, kubanga enguzi eziba amaaso g'omugezi era ebuzaabuza ebigambo by'abatuukirivu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
